      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just what people say to make it feel better, isn't it? like a Band-aid on a wound that's just part of my biology. it doesn't feel like a \"path to resilience.\" it feels like watching a clock count down. if the code is already written, then \"fighting it\" just feels like struggling against gravity. it’s exhausting to pretend i can change something that's basically built into my cells.",
