    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but what if it isn't a story? stories are meant to have arcs and growth. this just feels like a loop. my uncle, my dad... they all hit the same wall. it's like we're all just programmed to reach a certain breaking point. if you know the crash is coming no matter what you do, does trying to steer actually matter? it feels more like we're just prolonging the inevitable.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
