      "content": "Your concern about feeling trapped in an endless cycle is a deep-seated fear that must be approached with sensitivity. Acknowledging the cycle doesn't have to negate the value of striving for a different outcome. Each person navigating these patterns has their unique set of circumstances, and while your past and the experiences of your family are influential, they don't rigidly dictate every future outcome. Efforts towards steering your life, making conscious choices, and seeking help are steps toward potentially altering the cycle differently from those before you. It might not radically change predetermined factors, but it can contribute to a fresh chapter with differently paced arcs and growth. Your existence and well-being are invaluable, and you have the right to seek out yourself, in spite of, or because of, the pattern you perceive.",
      "source": "target",
